ShoalCave_Text_Materials:
	.string "Bring four SHOAL SALTS and four\n"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS from this cave.\p"
	.string "Your first collection earns GLALITITE,\n"
	.string "a Mega Stone for GLALIE.\p"
	.string "After that, each collection earns\n"
	.string "a BIG PEARL you can sell at a MART.\p"
	.string "Come speak to me again tomorrow.\n"
	.string "Then you can collect fresh materials.\p"
	.string "Look for salt at low tide and\n"
	.string "shells at high tide.$"
ShoalCave_Text_ConfirmExchange:
	.string "Trade four SHOAL SALTS and four\n"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS for a {STR_VAR_1}?$"
ShoalCave_Text_RewardBag:
	.string "The materials are perfect!\n"
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1} is in your BAG.$"
ShoalCave_Text_RewardPC:
	.string "The materials are perfect!\n"
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1} is in your item PC.$"
ShoalCave_Text_NoRoom:
	.string "Your BAG and item PC are full.\n"
	.string "Keep your materials until there's room.$"
ShoalCave_Text_Declined:
	.string "No hurry. Bring them back whenever\n"
	.string "you're ready to trade.$"

ShoalCave_Text_WasShoalSaltNowNothing:
	.string "There was some SHOAL SALT here.\n"
	.string "But, there's nothing here now.$"

ShoalCave_Text_WasShoallShellNowNothing:
	.string "There was a SHOAL SHELL here.\n"
	.string "But, there's nothing here now.$"
